        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a28">

                <pb facs="0570" n="520" xml:id="pg520"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 28.—From Lisbon to Buenos
                        Ayres.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-04"><hi rendition="#small-caps">April</hi> 4,
                        1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Command of Corvette Mindello:</hi></p>
                <p>There is no possible contingency in which the Government will permit the
                    disembarkation of the refugees. Also it can not buy the ship for £200,000. In
                    any case depart, saying where you are going, where a transport will go which
                    will relieve you. Telegraphic orders to this effect go to San Vincent.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Neves Ferreira.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
